<title>USA: Titan Holdings Inc Q1 net rises to $0.37/shr.</title>
<headline>Titan Holdings Inc Q1 net rises to $0.37/shr.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
